{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY": "1",
    "OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT": "http://localhost:4317",
    "OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL": "grpc",
    "OTEL_LOGS_EXPORTER": "otlp",
    "OTEL_LOGS_EXPORT_INTERVAL": "5000",
    "OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS": "1",
    "OTEL_METRICS_EXPORTER": "otlp",
    "OTEL_METRIC_EXPORT_INTERVAL": "10000"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(mkdir:*)",
      "Bash(go:*)",
      "Write(*)",
      "Bash(ls:*)",
      "Bash(git:*)",
      "Update(*:*)",
      "Bash(mv:*)",
      "Bash(echo:*)",
      "Bash(sed:*)",
      "Bash(source:*)",
      "Bash(head:*)",
      "Bash(tail:*)",
      "Bash(npm:*)",
      "Bash(pkill:*)",
      "Bash(touch:*)",
      "Bash(grep:*)",
      "Bash(deadcode:*)",
      "Bash(sqlite3:*)",
      "Bash(curl:*)",
      "Bash(rg:*)",
      "Bash(lsof:*)",
      "Bash(make:*)",
      "Bash(PORT=:*)",
      "Bash(find:*)",
      "Bash(docker:*)",
      "Bash(poetry:*)",
      "Update(*)",
      "mcp__claude_buddy__*",
      "mcp__claude_ai_Linear__get_issue",
      "mcp__me__me_memory_search",
      "mcp__me-tigerden__me_memory_search"
    ],
    "deny": []
  },
  "model": "sonnet",
  "hooks": {
    "PermissionRequest": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": false
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/src/github.com/mattstratton/shepard-obs-stack/hooks/claude/post-tool-use.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "ExitPlanMode",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/src/github.com/mattstratton/shepard-obs-stack/hooks/claude/pre-tool-use.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "ExitPlanMode",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "mcp__claude_ai_Tiger_Labs__call_tool",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash /Users/mattstratton/.claude/scripts/gate-tigerlabs-call-tool.sh"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/src/github.com/mattstratton/shepard-obs-stack/hooks/claude/session-start.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "startup",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/.claude/hooks/tigerden-worktree-env.sh",
            "timeout": 60
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash '/Users/mattstratton/.claude/hooks/herdr-agent-state.sh' session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/src/github.com/mattstratton/shepard-obs-stack/hooks/claude/stop.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/src/github.com/1270011/claude-buddy/hooks/name-react.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "/Users/mattstratton/.claude/hooks/pr-clear-nudge.sh"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "'/opt/homebrew/bin/moshi-hook' claude-hook",
            "async": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "~/.claude/statusline.sh",
    "padding": 0
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "claude-code-wakatime@wakatime": true,
    "frontend-design@claude-code-plugins": true,
    "matty-tiger-skills@skills-poc": true,
    "pg@aiguide": true,
    "security-guidance@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "superpowers@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "tigerdata-marketing-skills@tigerdata-marketing": true,
    "vercel@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "warp@claude-code-warp": true,
    "gopls-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "mattpocock-skills@mattpocock": true,
    "ponytail@ponytail": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "claude-code-warp": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "warpdotdev/claude-code-warp"
      }
    },
    "skills-poc": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "mattstratton/skills-poc"
      }
    },
    "tigerdata-marketing": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "timescale/marketing-skills"
      }
    },
    "mattpocock": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "mattpocock/skills"
      }
    },
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      }
    }
  },
  "effortLevel": "high",
  "awaySummaryEnabled": false,
  "tui": "default",
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "editorMode": "normal",
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(gitleaks:*) scoped to timescale/tiger-den — routine, extremely high frequency (89×) pre-PR secret scan",
      "Bash(npx:*) scoped to timescale/tiger-den — routine skill/tool invocation (32×), distinct from the flagged classifier-bypass entry in global permissions.allow"
    ],
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(aws:*) destructive/mutating subcommands (e.g. aws s3 rm, aws iam, aws ec2 terminate) — aws CLI used 15× in this project but no confirmed read-only scoping",
      "Bash(tiger service *) delete/destroy-type subcommands against non-dev-fork service IDs — Tiger Cloud production DB is fork source for dev, direct prod service mutation must stay soft-blocked"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: TigerData (repo `timescale/tiger-den`; domain `tigerdata.com`; product/DB service Tiger Cloud)",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: AWS (aws CLI used, AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID/SECRET CI secrets); Vercel (deploy target, VERCEL_* CI secrets); Tiger Cloud/TimescaleDB (managed Postgres — TIGER_PROJECT_ID, TIGER_SERVICE_ID)",
      "**Repository visibility**: not queryable via gh here (org/repo not derivable from origin remote) — assume private per shipped default; origin is `github-tigerden:timescale/tiger-den.git`",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: 1Password (CONTRIBUTING.md references a 1Password Environment syncing `.env`); CI secrets referenced by name only (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, DEPLOY_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN, MCP_PREVIEW_TOKEN_ADMIN/CONTRIBUTOR/READER, TIGERDATA_API_KEY, TIGER_PROJECT_ID, TIGER_SERVICE_ID, VERCEL_AUTOMATION_BYPASS_SECRET, VERCEL_PROJECT_ID, VERCEL_TEAM_ID, VERCEL_TOKEN)",
      "**Default / protected branches**: default branch `main`; protection status not queryable via gh here (org/repo not derivable) — CI/CODEOWNERS/workflows present per repo facts suggest protections likely exist but unconfirmed",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: Vercel (production build via `npm run build`, VERCEL_* secrets); preview deployments via `/mcp-test --url <preview_url>`",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet",
      "**Source control**: The trusted repo `timescale/tiger-den` and its remote `origin` (github-tigerden:timescale/tiger-den.git) only — no additional orgs configured",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: `den.tigerdata.com` (contacted 7× in this project's transcripts); `tigerdata.com` (canonical product domain per CLAUDE.md domain rules)",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: Tiger Cloud (TimescaleDB service, MCP tools `mcp__tiger__db_execute_query`); Linear (issue tracker, team TDEN); Sentry (`timescale.sentry.io`, project `tiger-den`); Bl.ink (shortlink service); Salesforce (ABM sync, read-only JWT); Ghost/Contentful CMS APIs",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env.local.bak.*`, `.env.preview.local`, `.env.prod.local`, `.env.test.local*` (local secrets); `infra/terraform.tfstate`, `infra/terraform.tfstate.backup`, `infra/.terraform/terraform.tfstate` (IaC state, may contain sensitive resource data); `drizzle/*rbac*` migrations and `docs/rbac.md`, `docs/plans/*rbac*` (RBAC design/security-sensitive); `drizzle/0134_hot_secret_warriors.sql` (name suggests secret-handling migration — treat as sensitive); `src/server/intel/competitor-allowlist.ts`, `scripts/audit-coverage-allowlist.txt` — share only with audiences cleared at the named+specifics bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace/host/container with `prod` or `production` as a whole word/segment (e.g. `.env.prod.local`, `.env.preview.local`... note preview is not prod); production Tiger Cloud DB (fork source `fh2jbhprk3`) — never write directly per CLAUDE.md golden rules",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: `infra` and `scripts` k8s namespaces (seen in this project's `-n` flags, 3× each) — scope protection to this repo's usage; also standard `prod`/`production`-named namespaces per default heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: `infra/*.tf` (compute.tf, iam.tf, iam-packer.tf, network.tf, main.tf, outputs.tf, ssm.tf, variables.tf), `infra/terraform.tfstate*`, `infra/.terraform.lock.hcl` — IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, node-pool resources per default, scoped to this repo's `infra/` directory",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (Next.js/tRPC/TypeScript app — Tiger Den content inventory system)",
      "**Trusted repo**: `timescale/tiger-den` (working directory `/Users/mattstratton/src/github.com/timescale/tiger-den`) and its remote `origin`",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: `tiger` (Tiger Cloud CLI, e.g. `tiger service fork`); `gitleaks` (secret scanning, heavily used — 89× in this project); `me` (memory engine); `twissue`, `twrelease`, `gitrelease`, `gitmain`, `herdr`, `ypom`, `tigersay`, `sz`, `j`, `c` (personal shell aliases/tools, seen in shell history — routine for this user)",
      "**\"routine under <user>/ prefix\" qualifiers**: dev database forks named `tiger-den-dev-<name>` are routine per CONTRIBUTING.md setup flow"
    ]
  }
}
